.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/56px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Vulnerable to Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png/28px-Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png/42px-Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png/56px-Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vulnerable to Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png/28px-Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Bludgeoning_Vulnerability.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Vulnerable to Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Lightning_Vulnerability.png/28px-Lightning_Vulnerability.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Lightning_Vulnerability.png/42px-Lightning_Vulnerability.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Lightning_Vulnerability.png/56px-Lightning_Vulnerability.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vulnerable to Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Lightning_Vulnerability.png/28px-Lightning_Vulnerability.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Lightning_Vulnerability.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul></div>\n</div></section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Conditions</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"conditions\" data-item-name=\"conditions\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sturdy_(Condition)\" title=\"Sturdy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sturdy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sturdy_(Condition)\" title=\"Sturdy (Condition)\"><b>Sturdy</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><ul><li>This material is rather strong. Only a hit that deals at least 10 damage can damage it.</li></ul></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\nThe <b>Deranged Force Curtain</b> is a malfunctioning device in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\">Wyrm's Rock Fortress</a>. \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Deranged Force Curtains can debuff <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/38px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/50px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enver Gortash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash</a> with vulnerability to certain types of damage. These devices only become active during combat. \n</p><p>After using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malfunctioning_Shell_of_Resistance\" title=\"Malfunctioning Shell of Resistance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Malfunctioning Shell of Resistance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Malfunctioning_Shell_of_Resistance\" title=\"Malfunctioning Shell of Resistance\">Malfunctioning Shell of Resistance</a> on a target, the force curtain gains <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Recharging_(Condition)\" title=\"Recharging (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharging\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Recharging_(Condition)\" title=\"Recharging (Condition)\">Recharging</a> and becomes disabled for 1 turn.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Combat\">Combat</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Attacks_and_actions\">Attacks and actions</span></h3>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-image nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Debuff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Generic_Debuff.webp/100px-Generic_Debuff.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Generic_Debuff.webp/150px-Generic_Debuff.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Generic_Debuff.webp/200px-Generic_Debuff.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Generic_Debuff.webp/100px-Generic_Debuff.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Generic_Debuff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-header\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malfunctioning_Shell_of_Resistance\" title=\"Malfunctioning Shell of Resistance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Malfunctioning Shell of Resistance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Malfunctioning_Shell_of_Resistance\" title=\"Malfunctioning Shell of Resistance\">Malfunctioning Shell of Resistance</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-content\">\n<p>Gortash gains <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w